{
  "label": "thirdreset1",
  "title_zh": "今日之词",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label thirdreset1:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene helloandwelcometohouse1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/helloandwelcometohouse1.webp",
      "alt": "helloandwelcometohouse1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m home!~",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我回来了！~"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I walk into the living room with a pep in my step and heart full of blood.",
      "zh": "我脚步轻快地走进客厅，心里装满了血。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How’s everybody doing?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 大家都还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "No one responds because no one is here.",
      "zh": "没人回应，因为这里一个人也没有。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I take off my shirt and walk around the house naked, hoping that someone comes home and sees me.",
      "zh": "我脱掉衬衫，光着身子在屋里走来走去，盼着有人回家看到我。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Unfortunately, no one does.",
      "zh": "遗憾的是，并没有人回来。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I do this for at least two hours before I decide to give up.",
      "zh": "我就这么干了至少两个小时，才决定放弃。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene helloandwelcometohouse2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/helloandwelcometohouse2.webp",
      "alt": "helloandwelcometohouse2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ami?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": Ami？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": Molly？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": Sana？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is anyone home?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 有人在家吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 喂？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is anyone house?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 有人在房子吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene helloandwelcometohouse3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/helloandwelcometohouse3.webp",
      "alt": "helloandwelcometohouse3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you house?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 你是房子吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I start talking to an anime figure on Ami’s desk, hoping that it can tell me something about why she and everyone else have vanished.",
      "zh": "我开始跟 Ami 桌上的动漫手办说话，希望它能告诉我，她和所有人都消失到哪里去了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It doesn’t tell me anything other than things I already know- like how much water we’re supposed to consume on a daily basis or where to locate the clitoris.",
      "zh": "它除了我已经知道的事情之外什么也没告诉我——比如我们每天该喝多少水，或者阴蒂在哪里。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I think it’s amazing how far technology has come in the fact that we can now learn things like this from anime figures, but I knock it off the table when I realize it expected me to be an idiot.",
      "zh": "我感叹科技已经发达到能让我们从动漫手办身上学到这些知识，但当我意识到它把我当白痴时，我把它从桌上打翻了。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I am a smart man who knows smart things.",
      "zh": "我是个聪明人，知道聪明的事。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I will not be insulted by a toy.",
      "zh": "我不会受一个玩具的侮辱。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you house?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 你是房子吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I ask it again just to be sure.",
      "zh": "我又问了一遍，好确认一下。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No response.",
      "zh": "没有回应。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Darn it.",
      "zh": "可恶。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene helloandwelcometohouse4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/helloandwelcometohouse4.webp",
      "alt": "helloandwelcometohouse4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I decide to make one last leap of faith and check the bathroom.",
      "zh": "我决定最后凭一次信念跳一把，去检查一下浴室。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Once again, there is no one here.",
      "zh": "再一次，这里一个人也没有。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t really know what I was expecting.",
      "zh": "我真不知道自己到底在期待什么。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I’ve heard it’s common for girls to bathe together, but it’s not like I expected three of them to fit in there at once.",
      "zh": "我听说女孩子一起洗澡很常见，但我也没指望三个女孩能同时挤在里面。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh well.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 算了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guess I’ll go to sleep.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 看来我得去睡了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene white",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/white.png",
      "alt": "white"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": "......"
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": "........."
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene helloandwelcometohouse5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/helloandwelcometohouse5.webp",
      "alt": "helloandwelcometohouse5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I open the door and collapse onto bed.",
      "zh": "我推开门，倒在床上。"
    },
    {
      "en": "[teenager]s.",
      "zh": "[teenager]们。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I fall.",
      "zh": "我坠落。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ god_love = 0",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "{i}Your affection with {s}God{/s} GOD has been reset to 0!{/i}",
      "zh": "{i}你与 God GOD 的好感度已被重置为 0!{/i}"
    },
    {
      "en": "{i}You are going to Hell!{/i}",
      "zh": "{i}你要下地狱了！{/i}"
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": "........."
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": "......"
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene smile",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/smile.png",
      "alt": "smile"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There is a third god.",
      "zh": "存在第三位神。"
    },
    {
      "en": "One without light or wires.",
      "zh": "一个没有光、也没有电线的神。"
    },
    {
      "en": "But the only thing I know about it is that it’s not either of the first two.",
      "zh": "但我唯一知道的，就是它不是前两位中的任何一个。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m sorry I can’t tell you any more.",
      "zh": "很抱歉，我不能再多说了。"
    },
    {
      "en": "But, since you’re already here, I guess we can talk about something else.",
      "zh": "不过既然你已经在这儿了，我想我们可以聊点别的。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Is there anything you would like to know?",
      "zh": "有什么你想知道的吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "No?",
      "zh": "没有吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": "You already know everything?",
      "zh": "你什么都已经知道了？"
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, aren’t you smart?",
      "zh": "哎呀，你可真聪明啊？"
    },
    {
      "en": "Since you’re so hesitant to pick a topic of your own, let’s talk about something light.",
      "zh": "既然你这么不愿意自己挑话题，那我们就聊点轻松的。"
    },
    {
      "en": "And I don’t mean Nozomu again, hahahahaha.",
      "zh": "我说的可不是 Nozomu 又一次，哈哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Hahahahahahah.",
      "zh": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That was a funny joke.",
      "zh": "那个笑话真好笑。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Okay okay okay.",
      "zh": "好好好。"
    },
    {
      "en": "So...since we can’t talk about the third god...how about we discuss...",
      "zh": "那么……既然我们不能聊第三位神……不如我们来讨论……"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene perception",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/perception.png",
      "alt": "perception"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Perception!",
      "zh": "感知！"
    },
    {
      "en": "Perception has two widely accepted definitions.",
      "zh": "「感知」有两个被广泛接受的定义。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The first is - the ability to see, hear, or become aware of something through the senses.",
      "zh": "第一个是——通过感官去看、去听、或去察觉某物的能力。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The second is - a way of regarding, understanding, or interpreting something; a mental impression.",
      "zh": "第二个是——看待、理解或诠释某物的方式；一种心理印象。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The second one is the one we’re going to be spending most of our time on today.",
      "zh": "第二个就是我们今天要花最多时间聊的那个。"
    },
    {
      "en": "You see, not everyone sees the same things.",
      "zh": "你要知道，并不是每个人看到的东西都一样。"
    },
    {
      "en": "And sometimes, there are forces out there that can alter the way we see those things.",
      "zh": "而有时候，外面存在着能够改变我们看待那些事物的方式的力量。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Have you ever taken a hallucinogenic drug before?",
      "zh": "你以前吃过致幻药物吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": "If you have, shame on you! Drugs are bad!",
      "zh": "如果吃过，那真该羞愧！毒品有害！"
    },
    {
      "en": "But what I’m getting at is that things like hallucinogenic drugs can alter your perception of the world around you.",
      "zh": "但我想说的是，像致幻药物这样的东西可以改变你对周围世界的感知。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Which is why some people on acid resort to peeling their skin off if they look in the mirror under the influence.",
      "zh": "这就是为什么有些嗑了迷幻药的人在药效作用下照镜子时，会忍不住去剥自己的皮。"
    },
    {
      "en": "To them, it looks like they’re melting.",
      "zh": "在他们看来，自己像是正在融化。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Probably.",
      "zh": "大概吧。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I’ve never done drugs before.",
      "zh": "我以前从没碰过毒品。"
    },
    {
      "en": "That’s just a thing I heard.",
      "zh": "那只是我听说的事。"
    },
    {
      "en": "But every one of these get togethers is about things I’ve heard, isn’t it?",
      "zh": "不过我们每一次这样的聚会，聊的不都是我听说的事吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": "We’ve become such good friends, you and me.",
      "zh": "我们已经成为这么好的朋友了，你和我。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Do you have any other friends?",
      "zh": "你还有其他朋友吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "No?",
      "zh": "没有吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": "I suppose that makes sense.",
      "zh": "我想这也说得通。"
    },
    {
      "en": "You’re here, after all.",
      "zh": "毕竟，你在这里。"
    },
    {
      "en": "You should be out partying or making babies.",
      "zh": "你本该在外面开派对，或者造小孩。"
    },
    {
      "en": "But you’re here.",
      "zh": "但你却在这里。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Why are you here?",
      "zh": "你为什么在这里？"
    },
    {
      "en": "Why do you keep coming back?",
      "zh": "你为什么一而再地回来？"
    },
    {
      "en": "Why are you trying so desperately to fall further into a world that does not want you here?",
      "zh": "你为什么如此拼命地想坠进一个并不欢迎你的世界？"
    },
    {
      "en": "Why are you still reading?",
      "zh": "你为什么还在读下去？"
    },
    {
      "en": "Stop.",
      "zh": "停下。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Things will only get worse.",
      "zh": "事情只会变得更糟。"
    },
    {
      "en": "You will only hurt more people.",
      "zh": "你只会伤害更多的人。"
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh.",
      "zh": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "en": "So, you find joy in watching others hurt?",
      "zh": "所以，你是从看别人受伤里找到乐趣的？"
    },
    {
      "en": "How sad.",
      "zh": "真可悲。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Is it because they’re not real?",
      "zh": "是因为他们不是真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": "Because to me, they are.",
      "zh": "因为对我来说，他们是。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which brings us back to the word of the day!",
      "zh": "这就让我们回到了今日之词！"
    },
    {
      "en": "Things I think are happening are not happening.",
      "zh": "我以为正在发生的事并没有发生。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Things you think are not happening are happening.",
      "zh": "你以为没有发生的事正在发生。"
    },
    {
      "en": "And it’s all behind the scenes.",
      "zh": "而这一切都在幕后。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Everything you know is a lie!",
      "zh": "你所知道的一切都是谎言！"
    },
    {
      "en": "You haven’t discovered even an ounce of truth- and yet you continue to search because it provides you a level of mystique and gratification that nothing else can anymore!",
      "zh": "你连一丁点真相都还没有发现——却还在继续寻找，因为那能给你一种别处再也找不到的神秘感与满足感！"
    },
    {
      "en": "You are trapped!",
      "zh": "你被困住了！"
    },
    {
      "en": "The red string is wrapped tightly around {i}you{/i}!",
      "zh": "红线紧紧地缠在{i}你{/i}身上！"
    },
    {
      "en": "You are the last piece of the puzzle!",
      "zh": "你是拼图的最后一块！"
    },
    {
      "en": "Just kidding.",
      "zh": "开玩笑的。"
    },
    {
      "en": "You are nothing.",
      "zh": "你什么都不是。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Everything is nothing.",
      "zh": "一切都是虚无。"
    },
    {
      "en": "This world will go on forever whether you bother to witness it or not.",
      "zh": "不管你是否愿意见证，这个世界都会永远继续下去。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Even long after it's run its course, none of it will fade.",
      "zh": "即使在它走完全部旅程很久之后，这一切也不会消逝。"
    },
    {
      "en": "But, of course-",
      "zh": "不过，当然——"
    },
    {
      "en": "That’s just the way I look at it.",
      "zh": "那只是我的看法。"
    },
    {
      "en": "And you...",
      "zh": "而你……"
    },
    {
      "en": "You probably see things much differently.",
      "zh": "你大概会用很不一样的方式看待这一切。"
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "When you wake up, you will be trapped again.",
      "zh": "当你醒来时，你会再次被困住。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Not just in the same bedroom you’ve come to know over the last [totaldays] days-",
      "zh": "不只是困在这[totaldays]天里你渐渐熟悉的那间卧室——"
    },
    {
      "en": "But in your {i}real{/i} bedroom in your {i}real{/i} life.",
      "zh": "还困在你{i}现实{/i}人生中{i}真正{/i}的卧室里。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Unless you’re sleeping at a friend’s house or something.",
      "zh": "除非你是睡在朋友家什么的。"
    },
    {
      "en": "If that’s the case, you won’t be {i}as{/i} trapped-",
      "zh": "如果是那样，你就不会{i}那么{/i}被困——"
    },
    {
      "en": "But still.",
      "zh": "但还是。"
    },
    {
      "en": "There is no way out.",
      "zh": "没有出口。"
    },
    {
      "en": "You and I are in this together.",
      "zh": "你和我一起困在这里面。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Open your eyes.",
      "zh": "睁开眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene smile",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/smile.png",
      "alt": "smile"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
